* Deliverable 2 Example Single-Transistor Netlist: PMOS_ON
* Absolute bias: Vd=0.0 Vg=0.0 Vs=0.9 Vb=0.9. Ground is the body node, so every
* source is shifted by -Vb (same device biases; avoids round-off in the body current).
.options gmin=1e-18 abstol=1e-18 reltol=1e-6 vntol=1e-9 numdgt=12
.temp 27.0

.include "45nm_HP.pm"

Vd d 0 DC -0.9
Vg g 0 DC -0.9
Vs s 0 DC 0
Vb b 0 DC 0

* Junction geometry: Ldiff = 2*Lmin = 90n, AD = AS = W*Ldiff, PD = PS = 2*(W+Ldiff)
M1 d g s b pmos W=180n L=45n AD=1.62000000e-14 AS=1.62000000e-14 PD=5.40000000e-07 PS=5.40000000e-07

.control
op
print -i(Vd)
print -i(Vg)
print -i(Vs)
print -i(Vb)
quit
.endc
.end
